OL,3,GNEWSADenby flagship store closes its
OL,4,Adoors for final time
OL,5,
OL,6,FDenby Pottery's flagship store in
OL,7,FDerbyshire has closed its doors for the
OL,8,Flast time, alongside all the iconic
OL,9,Fbrand's remaining sites.
OL,11,FOn Saturday morning, customers were
OL,12,Fseen queuing for a final closing down
OL,13,Fsale, with large parts of the shop now
OL,14,Fcompletely empty of stock.
OL,16,FFounded in 1809, the ceramics company
OL,17,Fappointed administrators in March after
OL,18,Ftwo centuries in business following
OL,19,Fstruggles with rising energy and labour
OL,20,Fcosts.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
