OL,3,GNEWSADenby flagship store closes its
OL,4,Adoors for final time
OL,5,
OL,6,FA source close to administrators FRP
OL,7,FAdvisory said the response from the
OL,8,Fpublic had been "phenomenal" with much
OL,9,Fhigher footfall and sales of stock than
OL,10,Fexpected in its final weeks of trading.
